OL,3,GNEWSAFloral tributes for man killed in
OL,4,ALidl crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFloral tributes have been placed at the
OL,7,Fscene where a man died after a car
OL,8,Fcrashed through the entrance of a Lidl
OL,9,Fsupermarket in Wolverhampton.
OL,11,FThe man, in his 30s, was pronounced
OL,12,Fdead at the scene after the crash,
OL,13,Fwhich emergency services were called to
OL,14,Fjust before 18:00 BST on 23 October.
OL,16,FTwo people also suffered serious
OL,17,Finjuries inside the building and remain
OL,18,Fin hospital, West Midlands Police said,
OL,19,Fwhile the driver, a woman in her 70s,
OL,20,Fwas taken to hospital for treatment and
OL,21,Fhas since been released.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
