OL,3,GNEWSAFloral tributes for man killed in
OL,4,ALidl crash
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Thoughts and prayers for the young man
OL,7,Fwho died, his family and friends," read
OL,8,Fa heartfelt message that had been tied
OL,9,Fto a bunch of pink flowers with a
OL,10,Fpurple ribbon.
